%%{init: {'look':'neo', 'theme':'redux-color'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    
    box "Client & Application"
        participant C as Client
        participant AC as Auth Controller
        participant H as Register Handler
        participant PH as Password Hasher
        participant U as User (Domain)
    end

    box "Persistence"
        participant WR as Repository / DbContext
        participant DB as PostgreSQL
    end

    box "Background Infrastructure"
        participant OS as Signal (Channel)
        participant OP as Outbox Processor
        participant RMQ as RabbitMQ
    end

    box "Email Delivery"
        participant EC as Email Consumer
        participant JTG as Jwt Generator
        participant SMTP as SMTP Server
    end

    Note over C, SMTP: == STAGE 1: Registration (Synchronous) ==

    C->>AC: POST /register {email, password...}
    AC->>H: Handle Command
    
    H->>WR: Check if Email Unique
    WR->>DB: SELECT Count(*) WHERE Email = ?
    DB-->>H: 0 (Unique)
    
    H->>PH: HashPassword(password)
    PH-->>H: "hashed_secret"
    
    H->>U: User.Create(email, hashed...)
    Note over U: 1. Creates User Entity<br/>(IsEmailVerified = false)<br/>2. Adds UserRegisteredEvent
    
    Note over H, DB: ATOMIC TRANSACTION
    H->>WR: SaveChangesAsync()
    
    rect rgb(255, 245, 245)
        Note right of WR: Inside DbContext
        WR->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
        WR->>DB: INSERT INTO Users
        WR->>DB: INSERT INTO OutboxMessages
        WR->>DB: COMMIT
    end
    
    WR-)OS: TryWrite(true) (Wake up signal)
    
    H-->>C: 200 OK { "Success" }
    
    Note over C, SMTP: == STAGE 2: Outbox Processing ==

    OS-)OP: Signal Received
    OP->>DB: SELECT * FROM OutboxMessages
    DB-->>OP: [UserRegisteredEvent]
    
    OP->>RMQ: Publish(UserRegisteredEvent)
    RMQ-->>OP: ACK
    
    OP->>DB: UPDATE OutboxMessages (Mark Processed)
    
    Note over C, SMTP: == STAGE 3: Verification Email ==
    
    RMQ->>EC: Consume(UserRegisteredEvent)
    
    Note right of EC: Token generated exclusively<br/>for the email
    EC->>JTG: GenerateVerificationToken(userId)
    JTG-->>EC: "eyJ..." (1 hour)
    
    EC->>SMTP: Send Email (link + token)
    SMTP->>C: Email in Inbox
    EC->>RMQ: ACK Message